#: ../../legacy/cmucam2/legal.rst:11
msgid "Disclaimer"
msgstr "Disclaimer"

#: ../../legacy/cmucam2/legal.rst:13
msgid ""
"The CMUcam2 was designed very carefully. We have made every effort to avoid "
"mistakes but we cannot guarantee that the CMUCam2 is free of errors. The "
"information found on this website is given as an indication."
msgstr ""
"De CMUcam2 is zeer zorgvuldig ontworpen. We hebben er alles aan gedaan om "
"fouten te vermijden, maar we kunnen niet garanderen dat de CMUCam2 vrij van "
"fouten is. De informatie op deze website wordt als indicatie gegeven."

